      "help_zh": "主机的存储类型，取值：\ndhg_local_ssd：本地SSD盘。\ndhg_cloud_ssd、dhg_cloud_essd：ESSD云盘",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "host_type",
      "options": [
        "--host-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "HostType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The state of the host. Valid values:\n\n0: The host is being created.\n1: The host is running.\n2: The host is faulty.\n3: The host is ready for disabling.\n4: The host is being maintained.\n5: The host is disabled.\n6: The host is restarting.\n7: The host is locked.\n\nWhen a host fails, the host is disabled. Before the host is disabled, the data of the instances that run on the host is migrated to another host",
      "help_zh": "主机状态，取值：\n\n0：创建中\n1：运行中\n2：故障中\n3：准备下线\n4：维护中\n5：已下线\n6：重启中\n7：锁定中\n\n当主机出现故障时，主机会下线，下线过程中主机会迁移实例数据",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "host_status",
      "options": [
        "--host-status"
